[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4467003772","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117022#issuecomment-4467003772","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117022","id":4467003772,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCkERfA","user":{"login":"MikkBenelis","id":17128667,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTI4NjY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17128667?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis","html_url":"https://github.com/MikkBenelis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-16T13:33:16Z","updated_at":"2026-05-16T13:33:16Z","body":"It seems the issue is related to the `PlaybackType` of an `AudioStreamPlayer`. I faced similar broken behavior too: the looping music with the `pitch_scale` set to `0.5` can randomly ignore the scale when playing or starting a new loop, especially when the screen/window/tab is not focused. When I changed the `PlaybackType` to `Stream` (which is set to `Sample` for Web exports) then it helped to resolve it. So I believe it needs to be investigated. Currently, the `PlaybackType` is marked as `Experimental`.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4467003772/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5860943319","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117022#issuecomment-5860943319","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117022","id":5860943319,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXVbl1w","user":{"login":"Qoltaic","id":146401461,"node_id":"U_kgDOCLnotQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146401461?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qoltaic","html_url":"https://github.com/Qoltaic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qoltaic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qoltaic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qoltaic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qoltaic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qoltaic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qoltaic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qoltaic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qoltaic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qoltaic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-27T23:46:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T23:46:46Z","body":"I would like to add that **audio plays from the right side only** in my case as well. using a method track works well as workaround.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5860943319/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]